    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30607" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγχράω</span></b>  and <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγχραύω</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνιχραύω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Nic.
			<u>Th.</u>
			277
		</span></i>:—like <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγχρίμπτω</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dash against</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνέχραυεν ἐς τὸ πρόσωπον τὸ σκῆπτρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					6.75
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυνόδοντά τισι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
				</span></i>
			 l. c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦσαν δὲ πρός τινας καὶ
				ἄλλους ε&lt;&gt;γκεχρημένοι</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόλεμοι</span>) <i>there were</i> wars
				<i>undertaken</i> . . , <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.145
			</span></i> (prob. 
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκεκρημένοι</span>
			).</div>
